50:The last tree of the goddess Immo has been cut down.
51:Malcolm: It's a bit sad without the other heroes, isn't it?:5_00133 They're stronger than me :5_00133 But do any of them write to you on parchments?:5_00134 Or can they be as annoying as me?:5_00134 I met this guy on Earth. He had a temper. His name was Raphael. Apparently he knocked someone out or something. Best of all, he was so fast you couldn't catch him.:5_00134
52:Hint:|Reach the place marked with a blue, pulsating ring